\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O bless the Lord, my soul!
\par Let all within me join,
\par And aid my tongue again to bless His name
\par Whose favours are divine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. O bless the Lord, my soul!
\par Nor let His mercies lie
\par Forgotten in unthankfulness,
\par And without praises die.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. 'Tis He forgives thy sins,
\par 'Tis He relieves thy pain,
\par 'Tis He that heals thy sicknesses,
\par And makes thee young.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. He fills the poor with good,
\par He gives the sufferers rest;
\par The Lord hath judgements for the proud,
\par And justice for the oppressed.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. His wondrous works and ways
\par He made by Moses known;
\par But sent the world His truth and grace
\par By His beloved Son.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

